or-runtime-3-1794593402980-zhrui5\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T18:23:32Z\",\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"checklist_evidence\":\"pass\",\"feature_catalog_code\":\"notApplicable\",\"skill_agent\":\"notApplicable\",\"spec_code\":\"pass\"},\"type\":\"iteration\"}\n{\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"dimensions\":[\"traceability\",\"maintainability\"],\"durationMs\":300000,\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:585-655,1057-1062,1505-1530,1680-1690\",\".opencode/plugins/tests/system-skill-advisor.test.cjs:481-520\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach.vitest.ts:110-125\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts:47-66,505-540,735-745\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-envelope.vitest.ts:67-105\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:25-75,123-140\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:21-120\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/derive-command-bridges-strings.vitest.ts:1-33\"],\"findingDetails\":[],\"findingsCount\":0,\"findingsNew\":[],\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":0},\"focus\":\"traceability-maintainability\",\"generation\":1,\"graphEvents\":[{\"id\":\"dim-maintainability-4\",\"kind\":\"DIMENSION\",\"label\":\"maintainability\",\"type\":\"node\"},{\"id\":\"dim-traceability-4\",\"kind\":\"DIMENSION\",\"label\":\"traceability\",\"type\":\"node\"},{\"id\":\"file-plugin\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\"system-skill-advisor.js\",\"type\":\"node\"},{\"id\":\"e9\",\"relation\":\"COVERS\",\"source\":\"dim-maintainability-4\",\"target\":\"file-plugin\",\"type\":\"edge\"},{\"id\":\"e10\",\"relation\":\"COVERS\",\"source\":\"dim-traceability-4\",\"target\":\"file-plugin\",\"type\":\"edge\"}],\"iteration\":4,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"newFindingsRatio\":0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Closing pass on the two remaining dimensions; the plugin removal and every changed test were confirmed without new defects.\",\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"fanout-advisor-runtime-3-1794593402980-zhrui5\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-advisor-runtime-3-1794593402980-zhrui5\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T18:26:08Z\",\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"agent_cross_runtime\":\"notApplicable\",\"checklist_evidence\":\"pass\",\"feature_catalog_code\":\"notApplicable\",\"playbook_capability\":\"notApplicable\",\"skill_agent\":\"pass\",\"spec_code\":\"pass\"},\"type\":\"iteration\"}\n---STRATEGY---\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent review state for the advisor-runtime-3 fan-out lineage. Narrow pass three: review only the changed lines of the files whose area in `review-scope-3.txt` is `advisor-runtime`, plus their callers, and report only defects with a concrete input.\n\n### Review Charter\n\n- Target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec folder), narrow changed-lines pass over the two remediation commits `ec1869dae8..1ca14a44`.\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability, one focus per iteration.\n- Stop conditions: convergence (weighted new-finding ratio under 0.10 after the second iteration) or `maxIterations=4`.\n- Success criteria: every changed line and its callers read; every finding carries `file:line` and a concrete failing input; holdout hygiene proved by a numstat-only check of the sealed file.\n- Write surface: this lineage directory only. No code changes, no repo tooling that writes outside it.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nCommand surfacing, review pass three, advisor-runtime area: the shared no-edit gate (`command-attach.ts`, `scorer/text.ts`, `scorer/fusion.ts`), the subprocess busy scan, the routing-accuracy runners (`command-offer.mjs`, `worktree-restore.mjs`, `run-command-behaviour.mjs`, `score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs`), `measure-brief-cost.mjs`, `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, the OpenCode plugin and the tests the remediation commits changed.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Re-reporting a pass-one or pass-two finding whose fix holds.\n- Re-reporting the four items listed under `Verifier follow-ups, coordinator` in `017-review-pass-two-remediation/tasks.md`.\n- Duplicating the `doctor-docs` area files (another lineage owns them).\n- Reading holdout prompt text. Only counts and a numstat line are permitted.\n- Changing code, running builds, the full suite, a daemon or a model CLI.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` under 0.10 at iteration 3 or later with all dimensions covered.\n- `maxIterations=4` reached.\n- A hard gate failure in the append gateway (exit 2) or a containment breach. Both halt the lineage.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n- [x] security\n- [x] traceability\n- [x] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 1\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Diff first, then a direct probe of the current function: it showed the T042 narrowing still misses the `make no changes to X` wording class (iteration 1).\n- Reading every resolve path in `runSpawnAttempt` before judging the new `sawBusy` flag: it ruled out a lost-retry defect without a test run (iteration 1).\n- Comparing each changed export to its caller and its changed test: the three-site fixture chain and the nine-name environment restore were confirmed without wid