{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595322552,"sessionID":"ses_e29ccdea6ffe1z7wL2sWcEOG4A","part":{"partID":"prt_1d63740bb001Qh6WJVX3YMp1ui","sessionID":"ses_e29ccdea6ffe1z7wL2sWcEOG4A","messageID":"msg_1d636a158001sHEk4B5UjH6n6v","type":"tool","id":"call_1f4acc99475847c2ac4f4b0c","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent review state for the noedit-confirm-3b fan-out lineage. Pass three confirming round over commit `860610d783`, which fixed the two findings of review pass three. This lineage owns the no-edit gate fix first and deepest and checks the doctor hook check once.\n\n### Review Charter\n\n- Target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec folder), reviewed through the two source files commit `860610d783` changed under `.skilled`.\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability.\n- Stop conditions: convergence (weighted new-finding ratio under 0.10) or `maxIterations=3`.\n- Success criteria: each of the two fixes judged by a concrete input run through the code, the callers of `isNoEditRequest` covered, and every finding carrying `file:line` plus the input and output observed.\n- Write surface: this lineage directory only. No code changes, no repo tooling that writes outside it.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nCommand surfacing review pass three confirming round: the `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` pattern and `isNoEditRequest` in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` with its callers `lib/scorer/text.ts` and `lib/scorer/fusion.ts`; and the node-flag reader (`readWords`, `simpleCommands`, `commandWords`, `nodeFlagSkipsScript`, `runsNodeOnMarker`, `scriptWord`, `runsMarker`) in `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs`.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- correctness\n- security\n- traceability\n- maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Re-reporting the pass-three findings `DR3-P1-001` and `AR3-P2-001` themselves; this round judges the fixes.\n- Reworking the whole advisor scorer or the whole doctor check.\n- Reading holdout prompt text. Only a numstat proof is permitted.\n- Changing code, running builds, the full suite, a daemon or a model CLI.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` under 0.10 with every dimension covered.\n- `maxIterations=3` reached.\n- A hard gate failure in the append gateway (exit 2) or a containment breach. Both halt the lineage.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [ ] correctness\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Waiting for iteration 1.\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n- None yet.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\nNone yet.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated -- consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: correctness - Focus area: the `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` pattern and `isNoEditRequest` in `command-attach.ts` plus its three call sites - Reason: this lineage owns the no-edit fix and reviews it first and deepest. - Rotation status: correctness first. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: none. - Required evidence: `file:line` for the changed line and the callers, a concrete prompt run through `isNoEditRequest`, and the observed boolean.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:287-295` (`NO_EDIT_REQUEST`, `isNoEditRequest`), callers `lib/scorer/text.ts:150`, `lib/scorer/fusion.ts:677`, `lib/scorer/fusion.ts:881`, hub attach `lib/command-attach.ts:335`; doctor check `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs:205-308`.\n- Behavior claims: commit `860610d783` says the flag reader now reads the flag name first, and the no-edit pattern now keeps a change request that says what to leave alone.\n- Reuse and conventions: one shared pattern serves every no-edit gate; the hook check reads shell words and never writes.\n- Review risks and gaps: `steer.md` is absent at init, so no lead ruling applied; `resource-map.md` is absent so its coverage gate is skipped.\n- Holdout hygiene: no holdout file is opened; only `git diff --numstat` may be read for a count.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file in the two changed files. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file in the two changed files. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No catalog page in the two changed files. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook in the two changed files. |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts | none yet | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts | none yet | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs | none yet | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs | none yet | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-noedit-confirm-3b-1794595021404-69frey, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-13T18:40:25Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent review state for the noedit-co