{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595556333,"sessionID":"ses_e29ccdea6ffe1z7wL2sWcEOG4A","part":{"partID":"prt_1d63b0158001tqoQ9siNj1Ub11","sessionID":"ses_e29ccdea6ffe1z7wL2sWcEOG4A","messageID":"msg_1d63af6b3001gR5yv0hNpjoUju","type":"tool","id":"call_0fb5fbe27459470b9590f243","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Running the same prompt through `isNoEditRequest`, `attachCommand` and `commandMeaningEligible` in one probe: it showed the same boolean moving all four gates at once (iteration 1).\n- Comparing the bare phrase with its object form in one probe pair (`make no changes` versus `make no changes to the tests`): it made the mirror regression unambiguous (iteration 1).\n- Reading the two added tests before judging the fix: it showed the suite has no genuine case with an object, so the regression cannot fail anything (iteration 1).\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n- Treating the pass-three case list as proof the class is closed: the guard deletes the phrase for real no-edit requests and only covers one separator (iteration 1).","oldString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Waiting for iteration 1.\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n- None yet.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -63,14 +63,16 @@\n - Resolved: 0\n \n <!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n-- Waiting for iteration 1.\n+- Running the same prompt through `isNoEditRequest`, `attachCommand` and `commandMeaningEligible` in one probe: it showed the same boolean moving all four gates at once (iteration 1).\n+- Comparing the bare phrase with its object form in one probe pair (`make no changes` versus `make no changes to the tests`): it made the mirror regression unambiguous (iteration 1).\n+- Reading the two added tests before judging the fix: it showed the suite has no genuine case with an object, so the regression cannot fail anything (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n-- None yet.\n+- Treating the pass-three case list as proof the class is closed: the guard deletes the phrase for real no-edit requests and only covers one separator (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":4,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n- Running the same prompt through `isNoEditRequest`, `attachCommand` and `commandMeaningEligible` in one probe: it showed the same boolean moving all four gates at once (iteration 1).\\n- Comparing the bare phrase with its object form in one probe pair (`make no changes` versus `make no changes to the tests`): it made the mirror regression unambiguous (iteration 1).\\n- Reading the two added tests before judging the fix: it showed the suite has no genuine case with an object, so the regression cannot fail anything (iteration 1).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n- Treating the pass-three case list as proof the class is closed: the guard deletes the phrase for real no-edit requests and only covers one separator (iteration 1).\",\"oldString\":\"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n- Waiting for iteration 1.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n- None yet.\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794595553624,"end":1794595556333}}}}
