{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794596012522,"sessionID":"ses_e29ccdea6ffe1z7wL2sWcEOG4A","part":{"partID":"prt_1d641fd2d001svWeQ75cq7cd7o","sessionID":"ses_e29ccdea6ffe1z7wL2sWcEOG4A","messageID":"msg_1d641ef58001cRYE5GvIT4qPXi","type":"tool","id":"call_2ea4ffa99c514d0d8d695c6f","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b && sed -n '/## 8. WHAT WORKED/,/## 9. WHAT FAILED/p' deep-review-strategy.md; echo \"===XREF===\"; sed -n '/MACHINE-OWNED: START/,/MACHINE-OWNED: END/p' deep-review-strategy.md | head -20"},"output":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Reading the check's trust boundary before judging the commit's claim: it showed a settings command is never executed and nothing is written, so no security surface moved (iteration 3).\n- Driving the doctor check as a process against fixture checkouts instead of reading the flag tables: it pinned all seventeen verdicts to printed output and exit codes (iteration 2).\n- Running the same prompt through `isNoEditRequest`, `attachCommand` and `commandMeaningEligible` in one probe: it showed the same boolean moving all four gates at once (iteration 1).\n- Comparing the bare phrase with its object form in one probe pair (`make no changes` versus `make no changes to the tests`): it made the mirror regression unambiguous (iteration 1).\n- Reading the two added tests before judging the fix: it showed the suite has no genuine case with an object, so the regression cannot fail anything (iteration 1).\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n===XREF===\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file in the two changed files. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file in the two changed files. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No catalog page in the two changed files. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook in the two changed files. |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts | D1, D2, D3, D4 | 3 | 0 P0, 1 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts | D1, D3 | 3 | 0 | complete |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs | D1, D2, D3, D4 | 3 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs | D1, D3 | 3 | 0 | complete |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Reading the check's trust boundary before judging the commit's claim: it showed a settings command is never executed and nothing is written, so no security surface moved (iteration 3).\n- Driving the doctor check as a process against fixture checkouts instead of reading the flag tables: it pinned all seventeen verdicts to printed output and exit codes (iteration 2).\n- Running the same prompt through `isNoEditRequest`, `attachCommand` and `commandMeaningEligible` in one probe: it showed the same boolean moving all four gates at once (iteration 1).\n- Comparing the bare phrase with its object form in one probe pair (`make no changes` versus `make no changes to the tests`): it made the mirror regression unambiguous (iteration 1).\n- Reading the two added tests before judging the fix: it showed the suite has no genuine case with an object, so the regression cannot fail anything (iteration 1).\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n===XREF===\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file in the two changed files. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file in the two changed files. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No catalog page in the two changed files. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook in the two changed files. |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts | D1, D2, D3, D4 | 3 | 0 P0, 1 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts | D1, D3 | 3 | 0 | complete |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs | D1, D2, D3, D4 | 3 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs | D1, D3 | 3 | 0 | complete |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b && sed -n '/## 8. WHAT WORKED/,/## 9. WHAT FAILED/p' deep-review-strategy.md; echo \\\"===XREF===\\\"; sed -n '/MACHINE-OWNED: START/,/MACHINE-OWNED: END/p' deep-review-strategy.md | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794596011309,"end":1794596012522}}}}
